Shapefile containing the county-level results for the HEFA Future Scenario detailed in Greene et al., 2025 (DOI Link: www.linkhere.com)

Scenario Description: 
    Conversion to Sustainable Aviation Fuel via HEFA – Future Targets: This scenario assumes advancements in lipid extraction and processing, including a single homogenization pass at lower pressure with 99% efficiency. 
    It assumes high lipid content is achieved without nutrient depletion or productivity losses. DAC costs are reduced to $50/ton, with an increased CUE of 90% during cultivation. 
    These enhancements align with future targets for the HEFA pathway, improving economic and environmental performance. 
